[{"client_msg_id":"1d274abb-a745-4f06-8c24-f02c0caa63cf","type":"message","user":"U025UTETFDJ","text":"起動時にセッションをリロードする仕組みを使っているので，その関係で失敗したのかもしれません．もう少し自分で調べてみます，ありがとうございます！","ts":"1637125961.033500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"di6Y"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U025UTETFDJ","text":"あ，この意味でした，曖昧ですみません","ts":"1637125906.032600","attachments":[{"color":"D0D0D0","fallback":"[November 17th, 2021 1:36 PM] thinca: プラグインの状態を復元したいわけではなくて、単にセッション経由でファイルを開いた時にプラグインの遅延ロードが実行されるかって話ですよね","author_id":"U03C71D7H","author_name":"thinca","author_subname":"thinca","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/U03C71D7H","author_icon":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2015-01-15/3417067010_04a676b32692fb2507e1_48.jpg","text":"プラグインの状態を復元したいわけではなくて、単にセッション経由でファイルを開いた時にプラグインの遅延ロードが実行されるかって話ですよね","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #question","ts":1637123803.030200,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CJMV3MSLR/p1637123803030200"}],"edited":{"user":"U025UTETFDJ","ts":"1637126039.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"25KZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e5ac3402-31d8-4dda-a190-50f665da6533","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"dein の初期化は普通は Vim 起動時にやるだろうし、起動後にセッションをロードしたのなら普通にプラグインロードも走りそうな気がするけど、状況が曖昧すぎるのと dein にも詳しくないのでなんとも言えない","ts":"1637124731.032500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"esper","count":1,"users":["U025UTETFDJ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EdGPW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b50621c9-f2c7-4b36-b7ef-3fe266945614","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"deinによるautoloadの登録がセッションロードより前に行われないと駄目です","ts":"1637124574.031500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U025UTETFDJ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UqveQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8